WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.540
- [Conan] Now I wanna ask
you, Isaac, something.

00:00:02.540 --> 00:00:04.223
You took a lot of anger.

00:00:04.223 --> 00:00:08.449
A lot of people on Twitter
blamed you for Hodor's death.

00:00:08.449 --> 00:00:12.616
(audience murmuring and laughing)

00:00:13.999 --> 00:00:15.845
That's why I sat the two of you together.

00:00:15.845 --> 00:00:17.528
(audience laughing)

00:00:17.528 --> 00:00:19.165
I wanted a really awkward conversation.

00:00:19.165 --> 00:00:20.559
How did you feel about that Twitter?

00:00:20.559 --> 00:00:21.754
They got mad!

00:00:21.754 --> 00:00:23.275
They were saying: "Hey,
that's your fault!"

00:00:23.275 --> 00:00:24.916
- [Isaac] Yeah, I woke up to a torrent of:

00:00:24.916 --> 00:00:27.816
"(beeping) you brands" and all sorts.

00:00:27.816 --> 00:00:28.744
(audience laughing)

00:00:28.744 --> 00:00:30.183
I had to say: "OK guys"--

00:00:30.183 --> 00:00:31.205
- [Conan] Isaac, if you're
gonna talk that way,

00:00:31.205 --> 00:00:32.320
you're not welcome here.

00:00:32.320 --> 00:00:33.724
(audience laughing)

00:00:33.724 --> 00:00:35.064
(laughing) I'm kidding.

00:00:35.064 --> 00:00:37.381
Please, all the f-bombs you want.

00:00:37.381 --> 00:00:38.612
- [Isaac] Oh my god. (chuckling)

00:00:38.612 --> 00:00:39.878
- [Conan] Did you feel--

00:00:39.878 --> 00:00:41.838
(laughing)

00:00:41.838 --> 00:00:44.626
Christian, how did you interpret it?

00:00:44.626 --> 00:00:48.121
Did you interpret it
that it was his fault?

00:00:48.121 --> 00:00:49.337
- [Christian] Well--

00:00:49.337 --> 00:00:51.428
(laughing)
(audience laughing)

00:00:51.428 --> 00:00:54.512
- [Conan] Any bitterness
towards Bran at all?

00:00:54.512 --> 00:00:55.876
- [Christian] If you're
talking to me or Hodor,

00:00:55.876 --> 00:00:56.863
it's two different things.

00:00:56.863 --> 00:00:58.790
I am terribly bitter towards him,

00:00:58.790 --> 00:01:02.204
but Hodor, I don't think Hodor blames you.

00:01:02.204 --> 00:01:03.713
- [Audience] Aw!

00:01:03.713 --> 00:01:07.796
(audience clapping and cheering)

00:01:09.341 --> 00:01:12.533
- [Christian] I do, I do, I do.

00:01:12.533 --> 00:01:14.635
(laughing)

00:01:14.635 --> 00:01:18.364
(audience clapping and cheering)

00:01:18.364 --> 00:01:21.194
- [Conan] That's very nice.

00:01:21.194 --> 00:01:22.027
Yes!

00:01:22.878 --> 00:01:24.191
It's very sweet.

